{"id": "math_phi1024", "category": "math", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T23:58:10", "prompt_tokens": 79, "completion_tokens": 187, "finish_reason": "stop", "decode_tps": 56.137673721200386, "wall_s": 3.998, "reasoning_chars": 223, "score": 1, "detail": {"expected": "512", "boxed": "512"}, "content": "质因数分解：\n\n\\[\n1024 = 2^{10}\n\\]\n\n欧拉函数：\n\n\\[\n\\varphi(1024)=\\varphi(2^{10})=2^{10}-2^{9}=1024-512=512\n\\]\n\n最终整数答案：\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{512}\n\\]"}
{"id": "math_zeros100", "category": "math", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T23:58:17", "prompt_tokens": 73, "completion_tokens": 340, "finish_reason": "stop", "decode_tps": 53.45697084418965, "wall_s": 6.839, "reasoning_chars": 259, "score": 1, "detail": {"expected": "24", "boxed": "24"}, "content": "100! 十进制末尾零的个数等于其质因数分解中因子 \\(5\\) 的个数（因为因子 \\(2\\) 更多）：\n\n\\[\nZ(100!) = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{100}{5} \\right\\rfloor + \\left\\lfloor \\frac{100}{5^2} \\right\\rfloor + \\left\\lfloor \\frac{100}{5^3} \\right\\rfloor + \\cdots\n\\]\n\n计算：\n\n\\[\n\\left\\lfloor \\frac{100}{5} \\right\\rfloor = 20\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\left\\lfloor \\frac{100}{25} \\right\\rfloor = 4\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\left\\lfloor \\frac{100}{125} \\right\\rfloor = 0\n\\]\n\n所以：\n\n\\[\nZ(100!) = 20 + 4 = 24\n\\]\n\n最终答案：\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{24}\n\\]"}
{"id": "math_pow7", "category": "math", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T23:59:06", "prompt_tokens": 76, "completion_tokens": 2662, "finish_reason": "stop", "decode_tps": 54.991848352280144, "wall_s": 48.86, "reasoning_chars": 2916, "score": 1, "detail": {"expected": "649", "boxed": "649"}, "content": "计算 \\(7^{2026} \\bmod 1000\\)。\n\n先找 \\(7\\) 模 \\(1000\\) 的循环周期。逐步计算：\n\n\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\n7^1 &\\equiv 7 \\pmod{1000}\\\\\n7^2 &\\equiv 49 \\pmod{1000}\\\\\n7^3 &\\equiv 343 \\pmod{1000}\\\\\n7^4 &\\equiv 401 \\pmod{1000}\\\\\n7^5 &\\equiv 807 \\pmod{1000}\\\\\n7^6 &\\equiv 649 \\pmod{1000}\\\\\n7^7 &\\equiv 543 \\pmod{1000}\\\\\n7^8 &\\equiv 801 \\pmod{1000}\\\\\n7^9 &\\equiv 607 \\pmod{1000}\\\\\n7^{10} &\\equiv 249 \\pmod{1000}\\\\\n7^{11} &\\equiv 743 \\pmod{1000}\\\\\n7^{12} &\\equiv 201 \\pmod{1000}\\\\\n7^{13} &\\equiv 407 \\pmod{1000}\\\\\n7^{14} &\\equiv 849 \\pmod{1000}\\\\\n7^{15} &\\equiv 943 \\pmod{1000}\\\\\n7^{16} &\\equiv 601 \\pmod{1000}\\\\\n7^{17} &\\equiv 207 \\pmod{1000}\\\\\n7^{18} &\\equiv 449 \\pmod{1000}\\\\\n7^{19} &\\equiv 143 \\pmod{1000}\\\\\n7^{20} &\\equiv 1 \\pmod{1000}\n\\end{aligned}\n\\]\n\n因此 \\(7^{20} \\equiv 1 \\pmod{1000}\\)，所以指数可模 \\(20\\) 化简：\n\n\\[\n2026 \\equiv 6 \\pmod{20}\n\\]\n\n于是\n\n\\[\n7^{2026} \\equiv 7^6 \\pmod{1000}\n\\]\n\n而\n\n\\[\n7^6 = 117649 \\equiv 649 \\pmod{1000}\n\\]\n\n最终答案为：\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{649}\n\\]"}
{"id": "code_palindrome", "category": "code", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T23:59:11", "prompt_tokens": 87, "completion_tokens": 240, "finish_reason": "stop", "decode_tps": 48.02171626399085, "wall_s": 5.306, "reasoning_chars": 744, "score": 1, "detail": {"returncode": 0, "stdout_tail": "PASS\n", "stderr_tail": "", "code_head": "def is_palindrome(s: str) -> bool:\n    cleaned = [ch.lower() for ch in s if ch.isalnum()]\n    return cleaned == cleaned[::-1]\n"}, "content": "```python\ndef is_palindrome(s: str) -> bool:\n    cleaned = [ch.lower() for ch in s if ch.isalnum()]\n    return cleaned == cleaned[::-1]\n```"}
{"id": "code_count_vowels", "category": "code", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T23:59:15", "prompt_tokens": 88, "completion_tokens": 144, "finish_reason": "stop", "decode_tps": 51.98911064446138, "wall_s": 3.189, "reasoning_chars": 397, "score": 1, "detail": {"returncode": 0, "stdout_tail": "PASS\n", "stderr_tail": "", "code_head": "def count_vowels(s):\n    return sum(1 for ch in s.lower() if ch in \"aeiou\")\n"}, "content": "```python\ndef count_vowels(s):\n    return sum(1 for ch in s.lower() if ch in \"aeiou\")\n```"}
{"id": "code_binary_search", "category": "code", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T23:59:20", "prompt_tokens": 86, "completion_tokens": 245, "finish_reason": "stop", "decode_tps": 54.80612669604185, "wall_s": 4.854, "reasoning_chars": 590, "score": 1, "detail": {"returncode": 0, "stdout_tail": "PASS\n", "stderr_tail": "", "code_head": "def binary_search(arr, target):\n    left, right = 0, len(arr) - 1\n    while left <= right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        if arr[mid] == target:\n            return mid\n        elif arr[mid] < target:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:\n            right = mid - 1\n    return -1\n"}, "content": "```python\ndef binary_search(arr, target):\n    left, right = 0, len(arr) - 1\n    while left <= right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        if arr[mid] == target:\n            return mid\n        elif arr[mid] < target:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:\n            right = mid - 1\n    return -1\n```"}
